# A second animation keeps the Avatar type gained after the first animation (CR 205.1b).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mishra's Factory
Black Lotus
Enter the Avatar State
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mishra's Factory.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mishra's Factory.Activate(Ability: {1})
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Enter the Avatar State.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mishra's Factory)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mishra's Factory.Subtypes = Assembly-Worker; Avatar
Bot1.Battlefield.Mishra's Factory.Activate(Ability: {1})
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mishra's Factory.Subtypes = Assembly-Worker; Avatar
